y":"元"}},{"title":"访杜弘道长史不值道中偶成","author":"虞集","text":"雨浥轻尘道半乾，朝回随处借花看。\n墙东千树垂杨柳，飞絮时来近马鞍。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23581,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"听雨","author":"虞集","text":"屏风围坐鬓毵毵，绛蜡摇光照暮酣。\n京国多年情尽改，忽听春雨忆江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23582,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春云","author":"虞集","text":"春云漠漠度宫城，楼雪初融水未生。\n行过御沟成久立，起头枝上有流莺。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23583,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"与赵子期趋阁","author":"虞集","text":"日出风生太液波，画桥千尺彩船过。\n桥头柳色深如许，应是偏承雨露多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23584,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉堂读卷杂赋次韵 其一","author":"虞集","text":"待漏宫门听钥开，袖中进卷总贤才。\n奏名殿里千花合，传敕阶前好雨来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23585,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"玉堂读卷杂赋次韵 其二","author":"虞集","text":"千花覆槛柳垂丝，昼刻传呼淑景迟。\n圣主自观新进策，侍臣簪笔立多时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23586,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"院中独坐","author":"虞集","text":"何处他年寄此生，山中江上总关情。\n无端绕屋长松树，尽把风声作