:"元"}},{"title":"画马二首 其一","author":"虞集","text":"萧条沙苑贰师还，苜蓿秋风尽日閒。\n白发圉人曾习御，长鸣知是忆关山。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23593,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"画马二首 其二","author":"虞集","text":"虢国夫人学画眉，宫门催入许先驰。\n春风十里闻芗泽，新赐金鞍不受骑。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23594,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题纳凉图","author":"虞集","text":"百顷芙蓉水满堤，绮窗只在画桥西。\n羊车薄暮过湖曲，惊起鸳鸯不并栖。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23595,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"息斋竹","author":"虞集","text":"紫貂早解猎围骖，一棹夷犹雪满簪。\n山雨欲来春树暗，尽将情思写江南。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23596,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题子昂春江听雨图","author":"虞集","text":"忆昔江湖听雨眠，翩翩归雁度春前。\n数株古木依茅舍，老去何年踏钓船。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23597,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵杜德常典签秋日西山有感二首 其一","author":"虞集","text":"落日龙舟山下回，寺门依旧对山开。\n霜凋碧树烟生草，从此频伤八月来。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":23598,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"次韵杜德常典签秋日西山有感二首 其二","author":"虞集","text":"每进文章出殿迟，日华西转万年枝。